  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "Version 2.30.92 - faster analysis on code unrelated to AutoMapper\n- Analyzers register on every invocation in a compilation; the shared AutoMapper-method check now compares the invoked name syntactically before binding symbols\n- Shapes whose name cannot be read still resolve semantically, so the gate can only skip work and never changes a diagnostic\n- Measured against a new throughput baseline: directionally ~12% lower analysis time on code that is mostly unrelated to AutoMapper\n- No rule ID, severity, or diagnostic changes",
